<heading>accounts list - List all accounts.</heading>

<rule/>

<heading level="2">
Usage
</heading>

<pre>
  list
</pre>

<heading level="2">
Description
</heading>

<paragraph>
Lists all registered accounts. Humans carry a profile (name, mail,
language); bots are accounts without a profile.
</paragraph>

<heading level="2">
Examples
</heading>

<pre>
list
  Show all accounts.
</pre>

<heading level="2">
See also
</heading>

<paragraph>
add, edit, delete, groups, grants
</paragraph>
